	     all (docs/PRIVACY_POLICY.md). The IDs are Google's published set for
	     the Google Mobile Ads SDK and its buyers
	     (https://developers.google.com/admob/ios/quick-start and
	     /admob/ios/3p-skadnetworks, fetched 2026-08-17). Google maintains the
